---
source: crates/quill-tui/tests/settings.rs
expression: outline(&window.shown())
---
== General (general, gearshape)
   appearance "Appearance:": choice = system of system "System" | light "Light" | dark "Dark"
     help: System follows the Mac, and changes with it.
   theme_light "Light theme:": choice = dark of dark "Dark" | light "Light" | terminal "Terminal"
   theme_dark "Dark theme:": choice = dark of dark "Dark" | light "Light" | terminal "Terminal"
   import_theme "": button "Import Theme…"
     help: Themes made for Ghostty can be imported. Themes of your own are files in the themes folder beside the settings file.
   keymap "Keys:": choice = vim of vim "Vim" | mutt "Mutt"
     help: Keys of your own in keys.toml stay on top of either.
   notifications "New mail:": toggle "Show a notification when mail arrives" = true
   threads "Message list:": toggle "List the messages of a conversation together" = true
   web_reading "Reading:": toggle "Read mail in a web pane beside the list" = false
   more: Rules and saved searches are set in the settings file. Hooks and templates are files beside it.
== Accounts (accounts, at)
   accounts "": list
     action add "Add an Account…"
     action sign_in "Sign In…", of a row
     action edit "Edit…", of a row
     action remove "Remove…", of a row
     empty: No accounts yet.
     help: Edit… changes an account’s servers, the name it signs in with and its password. Removing an account takes it out of the settings file and the Keychain, and deletes the copy of its mail kept on this Mac. Mail on its server is not touched.
   more: Rules and saved searches are set in the settings file. Hooks and templates are files beside it.
== Composing (composing, square.and.pencil)
   editor "Write in:": choice = builtin of builtin "Quill’s own editor" | vim "Vim" | nano "nano" | pico "Pico" | mg "mg"
     help: An editor other than Quill’s own is yours, with your own settings for it: Vim reads your vimrc. Takes effect when Quill is next opened.
   format "Format:": choice = markdown of markdown "Markdown, sent as formatted text" | plain "Plain text"
   reply_position "Replies:": choice = above of above "Above the quoted message" | below "Below the quoted message"
   spell_check "Spelling:": toggle "Check spelling as you type" = true
   undo_send_seconds "Undo send:": number = 10 from 0 to 4294967295 by 1, 0 places, seconds
     help: How long a sent message waits in the Outbox, where it can be taken back. 0 sends at once.
   more: Rules and saved searches are set in the settings file. Hooks and templates are files beside it.
== Privacy (privacy, hand.raised)
   remote_images "Remote pictures:": choice = ask of ask "Ask for each message" | never "Never load them"
     help: Pictures and other content a message would fetch from the internet. Asked for, nothing is fetched until you say so for a message or for its sender.
   more: Rules and saved searches are set in the settings file. Hooks and templates are files beside it.
== Storage (storage, internaldrive)
   cache_gb "Keep up to:": number = 5 from 0 to any by 1, 2 places, GB of downloaded mail
     help: Past that the oldest downloaded copies are let go, and fetched again when next opened. 0 is no limit. Mail of a POP3 account is never cleared. Takes effect when Quill is next opened.
   more: Rules and saved searches are set in the settings file. Hooks and templates are files beside it.
